    "body": "Shared statements (apply only to contexts referencing them):\nF1: Zephyr deployments require a passing preflight before any apply operation.\nF2: Use only the command and limits specified for the named deployment environment.\n\nContext: Zephyr staging deployment\n[F1] [F2] For Zephyr staging, use `zx stage-apply` with 3 workers, 2 retries and a 30 second timeout.\n\nContext: Zephyr production deployment\n[F1] [F2] For Zephyr production, use `zx prod-apply` with 1 worker, 0 retries and a 90 second timeout."
